TI  - An NLP Framework for the Extraction of Concept Measurements from Radiology and 
      Pathology Notes.
PG  - 1446-1447
LID - 10.3233/SHTI231237 [doi]
AB  - Natural language processing (NLP) tools can automate the identification of cancer 
      patients eligible for specific pathways. We developed and validated a cancer 
      agnostic, rules-based NLP framework to extract the dimensions and measurements of 
      several concepts from pathology and radiology reports. This framework was then 
      efficiently and cost-effectively deployed to identify patients eligible for 
      breast, lung, and prostate cancers clinical pathways.
